SUMMARY:Grand Opening Weekend of the Stevens & Smith Center
DESCRIPTION:Grand Opening Weekend\n\n\n\nIt’s the moment we’ve all been waiting for: the Grand Opening of the Thaddeus Stevens & Lydia Hamilton Smith Center for History and Democracy! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGrand Opening Weekend Events\n\n\n\nJoin LancasterHistory for a weekend celebration\, including a ribbon cutting\, Grand Opening Gala\, and a family-friendly community block party! \n\n\n\n\nPreviousNext\nRibbon Cutting\nFri May 1 | 8-10amThe excitement kicks off Friday morning as we officially open the Center with a celebratory ribbon-cutting! Free & open to the public. RSVPs requested. \n\n\n\nLearn More\n\n\n\n\nFete – SOLD OUT\nFri May 1 | 5:30-9:30pmThis exclusive\, ticketed event brings together our closest supporters for a night of gratitude and recognition\, just next door in Commons on Vine. \n\n\n\nSOLD OUT\n\n\n\n\nCommunity Block Party\nSat May 2 | 12-6pmOur Grand Opening takes over East Vine Street for a buzzing community block party! Free & open to the public. All are welcome! \n\n\n\nLearn More\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThank You to Our Grand Opening Sponsors\n\n\n\nPresenting Sponsors\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLegacy Building Sponsors\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCommunity Champion Sponsors\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCivic Partner Sponsors\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEducation Advocate Sponsors\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFriend of the Center Sponsors\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvents Made Possible By\n\n\n\nMike Abel | Brenneman Printing | Cracked Pepper Catering | The Gilded LilyThe Lancaster County Convention Center | The Lancaster Marriott at Penn Square | Speak to My SoulT.H.E.M The Collective | PRIMA Theatre | Shumaker PDT | We & Co.
URL:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/event/grand-opening-weekend-of-the-stevens-smith-center/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/Grand-Opening-Temp-Graphic.avif
