SUMMARY:[SOLD OUT] The First Look Fête
DESCRIPTION:Sold OutThe First Look Fête\n\n\n\nFriday evening culminates in an elegant\, high-end cocktail celebration honoring the extraordinary generosity and bold vision that brought the Stevens & Smith Center to life. This exclusive\, ticketed event brings together our closest supporters for a night of gratitude and recognition\, just next door in the newly renovated Commons on Vine. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nInterest in the event was overwhelming and the event sold out very quickly. Thank you for your interest! There are more ways to celebrate the Stevens & Smith Center Grand Opening. Consider joining us for the Ribbon Cutting Ceremony or the Community Block Party for History! \n\n\n\nGuests will enjoy curated cocktails\, elevated fare\, lively entertainment\, and one of the very first opportunities to experience the Center up close. It’s more than a party\, it’s a toast to the partners and donors who made history possible\, and a sparkling first look at what’s ahead. \n\n\n\nDress for the First Look Fête is cocktail attire. The schedule of events is as follows: \n\n\n\n\n5:30PM: Cocktails and lavish bites\n\n\n\n7:00PM: Program and performances\n\n\n\n7:30PM: Dessert and music\n\n\n\n\n… and then we welcome you inside the Stevens & Smith Center for first looks!
URL:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/event/sold-outthe-first-look-fete/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/Fete_Web.avif
END:VEVENT
